sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (terminal)
    participant R as REPL thread
    participant S as AgentSession
    participant A as AgentRunner (agent thread)
    participant M as Model API
    participant T as Tool / WorkspaceChanges

    U->>R: prompt
    R->>S: add_user_message
    R->>A: run_turn_with_steering (background thread)
    A->>S: begin_turn()
    loop until no tool calls
        A->>M: messages + tool schemas
        M-->>A: assistant message (+tool_calls?)
        A->>S: add_assistant_message
        alt steering pending before call N
            A-->>S: mark remaining calls cancelled
            A->>S: add_tool_result("cancelled ...")
        else normal execution
            A->>T: execute_tool_call
            T-->>A: result (cached if deterministic & unchanged)
            A->>S: add_tool_result (grouped, protocol-safe)
        end
    end
    U->>R: types while agent works
    R->>S: queue_steering (FIFO)
    A->>S: flush_steering at safe boundary
    A-->>R: turn complete
    R-->>U: render final output
